  },
  {
   "id": "t_d38b562f6ccd034d3fa1",
   "sourceHash": "d38b562f6ccd034d3fa115ea3148a4b19d0296f56f01fd6d1f93ffcf077fee0b",
   "text": "1项治疗项目套餐包括：每日一次阿育吠陀按摩，Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2bbb97b9ad2b72fc647d",
   "sourceHash": "2bbb97b9ad2b72fc647d23e6ef84b529a4f8433632dee0a087ef9ec3d2643b07",
   "text": "2项治疗项目套餐包括：一次 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽），以及根据医生处方安排的一项额外阿育吠陀治疗（如 Shirodhara（希罗达拉）、Pizhichil（皮兹奇尔）、草本磨砂等）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_08e7c1f7fa2995a9f086",
   "sourceHash": "08e7c1f7fa2995a9f086d74b98c8b372e5184f65ab44a44b7bea4ca9a6639a8b",
   "text": "注：不包括交通安排（机票及机场接送）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_df2f790f0858ed03ab08",
   "sourceHash": "df2f790f0858ed03ab08572a393eea26cdf3fdb317f764c8d5f8e580d2d60152",
   "text": "Lakshya 是一位认证瑜伽老师，拥有7年以上的哈他瑜伽教学与练习经验。她曾在印度深入学习瑜伽，并在印度哥印拜陀（Coimbatore）师从其上师 Swami Dayananda Saraswati，完成了为期3年的吠檀多、梵语和吠陀诵唱课程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b5b4bcec793421cf76cb",
   "sourceHash": "b5b4bcec793421cf76cb126b6b0b71f290a6aae549a727b8c639fc5352ecd531",
   "text": "Lakshya 的课程充满活力，注重呼吸与动作的协调，让学员探索自身的潜能。她引导各个水平的练习者发掘内在的喜悦与幸福感。对 Lakshya 而言，瑜伽不只是一种练习——更是一种生活方式。更多信息，请访问 www.lakshyayoga.com爱与祝福，Om。Lakshya [Elouise Erlings]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
